{"seq":3,"slug":"docs-vs-context-files","title":"文档与上下文文件的分工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-vs-context-files","wordCount":2069,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"文档与上下文文件的分工\">文档与上下文文件的分工</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>AGENTS.md、CLAUDE.md、GEMINI.md 这类上下文文件和 README、架构文档、决策记录都是「写给 agent 也给人读的知识」，但它们在装载机制、篇幅预算和失效后果上是两种工程构件。混用的代价是双向的：把整本文档塞进上下文文件，等于让每个会话为重复内容持续付费；把每个任务都需要的硬约束埋进长文档深处，则等于赌 agent 碰巧翻到那一页。2025 年以来三大工具阵营各自固化了装载机制——Claude Code 在每个会话开始时装载 CLAUDE.md（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">code.claude.com/docs/en/memory</a>），Gemini CLI 把 GEMINI.md 层级拼接后随每次提示发送（<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">gemini-cli docs</a>），AGENTS.md 则以嵌套与就近覆盖规则被 6 万多个开源项目采用（<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>）。理解这些机制的差异，是划清分工的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两类载体是两种工程构件，不是同一份知识的两处副本：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>常驻指令层</strong>：AGENTS.md、CLAUDE.md、GEMINI.md 一类，会话开始自动注入；内容性质是可执行的规则、命令、禁区，失效后立即污染所有任务的每一步。</li>\n<li><strong>按需知识层</strong>：README、架构文档、决策记录，由 agent 经工具或索引取用；内容性质是可验证的知识，失效只误导读它的那次任务。</li>\n<li><strong>分工判据</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>放常驻层</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{放常驻层} \\iff p_{use} \\times v &gt; c_{resident}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">放常驻层</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——单任务命中概率乘踩错损失，是否大于它占据的每会话 token 开销。</li>\n<li><strong>路由器模式</strong>：常驻层只留命令、铁律与指向细节的指针，同一知识只写一处、他处用链接指向；两层互指，而不是把内容抄两份。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"两类载体-常驻指令层与按需知识层\">两类载体：常驻指令层与按需知识层</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>上下文文件</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>装载方式</td>\n<td>会话开始自动注入，无需检索</td>\n<td>agent 经工具/索引按需获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费模型</td>\n<td>每个任务重复计入上下文</td>\n<td>只在读取的那次任务付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合理篇幅</td>\n<td>数十行量级，越精炼越被遵守</td>\n<td>不限，靠结构支撑扫读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容性质</td>\n<td>规则、命令、禁区：可执行的指令</td>\n<td>架构、动机、参考：可验证的知识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失效后果</td>\n<td>立即污染所有任务的每一步</td>\n<td>仅误导读到它的那次任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的「计费模型」一行是分工的经济学根源。常驻层的内容无论是否用得上，每个会话都要支付全额 token 成本；按需层只在真正读取时计费。于是分工判据可以写成一条不等式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>放常驻层</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{放常驻层} \\iff p_{use} \\times v \\;&gt;\\; c_{resident}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">放常驻层</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{use}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个任务用到该知识的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是用错时的损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{resident}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是它占据的每会话 token 开销。构建命令、代码风格铁律、「不要动这个目录」之类的禁区几乎每个任务都高频命中且踩错代价大，天然属于常驻层；某个子系统的设计沿革只有改到那个子系统时才被需要，放进常驻层就是让全部任务为少数任务买单。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph R[&quot;常驻指令层 · 每次会话自动注入&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;.claude/rules/ 按路径生效的规则&quot;]&#10;        A3[&quot;auto memory(工具自记,限量装载)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph D[&quot;按需知识层 · 工具检索时才读&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;README&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;architecture.md&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;决策记录 ADR&quot;]&#10;        B4[&quot;API reference&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 -- &quot;指针:&#39;架构详见 docs/arch...&#39; &quot; --&gt; B2&#10;    A1 -- 指针 --&gt; B3&#10;    A2 -- glob 命中才注入 --&gt; R0((&quot;对应路径的任务&quot;))\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph R[\"常驻指令层 · 每次会话自动注入\"]\n        A1[\"AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / GEMINI.md\"]\n        A2[\".claude/rules/ 按路径生效的规则\"]\n        A3[\"auto memory(工具自记,限量装载)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph D[\"按需知识层 · 工具检索时才读\"]\n        B1[\"README\"]\n        B2[\"architecture.md\"]\n        B3[\"决策记录 ADR\"]\n        B4[\"API reference\"]\n    end\n    A1 -- \"指针:'架构详见 docs/arch...' \" --&gt; B2\n    A1 -- 指针 --&gt; B3\n    A2 -- glob 命中才注入 --&gt; R0((\"对应路径的任务\"))</pre><h2 id=\"三家实现对照-机制差异决定写法\">三家实现对照：机制差异决定写法</h2><p>三家对「常驻」的具体定义不同，写法必须跟着机制走。</p>\n<p><strong>Claude Code</strong>：CLAUDE.md 与 auto memory 双轨。前者由人书写、作用域分项目/用户/组织两级以上；后者由 Claude 自己记录你的纠正与偏好，每次会话只装载前 200 行或 25KB。官方文档特别提醒两点：CLAUDE.md 被当作 context 而非强制配置，要硬性拦截动作得用 PreToolUse hook；指令越具体、越简洁，被遵循的一致性越高（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">code.claude.com/docs/en/memory</a>）。另有 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 支持按文件路径匹配生效的规则。</p>\n<p><strong>Gemini CLI</strong>：三层层级记忆——全局 <code>~/.gemini/GEMINI.md</code> 提供跨项目默认值；工作区及其父目录的 GEMINI.md 提供项目上下文；JIT 层在工具访问某个目录时自动扫描该目录及祖先直到受信根目录，实现「用到某组件时才注入它的专属指令」。CLI 会把找到的所有上下文文件拼接后随每条提示发送，页脚显示已装载的文件数，并可用 <code>/memory show</code> 查看拼接结果、<code>@file.md</code> 语法拆分导入（<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">gemini-cli docs</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>AGENTS.md</strong>：定位是「agent 的 README」，刻意与面向人的 README 分离，无必填字段、纯标准 Markdown。monorepo 场景支持嵌套：agent 自动读取离被编辑文件最近的 AGENTS.md，冲突时最近者胜，而用户聊天中的显式指令覆盖一切；OpenAI 主仓库在撰写时就有 88 个 AGENTS.md 分布在各包中（<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>）。Gemini CLI 也能通过 <code>settings.json</code> 把上下文文件名指向 AGENTS.md，实现一套文件多端通用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-两种失败的混合\">反模式：两种失败的混合</h2><p><strong>臃肿型</strong>——把文档逐段拷进上下文文件。后果不只是贵：Claude Code 的故障排查文档专门列有「My CLAUDE.md is too large」条目，因为超长的常驻指令会稀释每条规则的遵守率（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">code.claude.com/docs/en/memory</a>）。官方给的修复方向正是拆分：用 <code>.claude/rules/</code> 把规则按路径下沉，或用导入语法引用外部文件，而不是删信息。</p>\n<p><strong>埋葬型</strong>——反过来，把每个任务都需要的硬约束写进长文档第三章。agent 的检索不保证命中，未读到的规则等于不存在；更糟的是 agent 会自信地按错误假设完成任务，产出看似合理的偏差实现。判断一个知识点是否被埋葬，可以用上一节的概率判据反向检验：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{use}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1 的知识出现在按需层，就是埋葬。</p>\n<p>两者共同的病根是<strong>同一知识写两处</strong>。副本必然漂移：常驻层说「用 pnpm」，文档里残留「npm run dev」，agent 面对矛盾时的选择不可控。修复靠单一事实源加指针——知识按定位只写在一处，另一处用一行链接指过去。agents.md 的 FAQ 甚至给出了存量迁移的机械做法：重命名旧文件并用符号链接保持向后兼容（<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>），这暗示了分工改造可以渐进完成，不必一次性推翻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"让两层互指-路由器模式\">让两层互指：路由器模式</h2><p>健康的知识库把上下文文件当<strong>路由器</strong>而非仓库：常驻层只保留三类东西——怎么装跑验的命令、不可违反的约定、指向细节的显式指针；一切需要篇幅展开的解释都住在文档里，由常驻层的一行链接可达。这样 agent 的典型路径变成：会话启动拿到地图 → 执行常规动作零额外成本 → 遇到特定领域问题时顺指针深入对应文档。Gemini CLI 的 JIT 目录扫描其实是同一思想的机制化——把「哪个目录有什么规矩」下沉到目录本身，让注入时机贴近使用时机。</p>\n<p>维护上两层要同步更新但职责不同：常驻层变更走最严格的审查（因为它立即影响所有任务），文档变更则可以随代码迭代。给常驻层的每条规则标注来源与日期是个低成本习惯，便于日后判断哪些规则已经过时而应淘汰——上下文文件的熵增没有自然清理机制，只能靠人工修剪维持预算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>上下文文件是每个会话自动计费的常驻指令层，文档是按需取用的知识层；分工判据是一条使用频率对常驻成本的权衡式。三家工具机制各异但共同印证：常驻层贵在精不在全，细节留在按需层，两层用指针连接且同一知识只写一处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../kinds-of-docs-that-help/readme-as-entry-point\">README 作为入口</a>：按需知识层的头号入口——它与本层 AGENTS.md、站点级 llms.txt 的三层入口分化。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../docs-that-stay-true/doc-rot-and-agents\">文档腐烂与 Agent</a>：常驻指令层没有自然清理机制，熵增修剪的具体做法在那篇展开。</li>\n<li><a href=\"who-reads-docs-now\">现在谁在读文档</a>：分工判据的前提——两类读者的读取机制差异。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文档与上下文文件的分工","id":"文档与上下文文件的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两类载体：常驻指令层与按需知识层","id":"两类载体-常驻指令层与按需知识层"},{"level":2,"text":"三家实现对照：机制差异决定写法","id":"三家实现对照-机制差异决定写法"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：两种失败的混合","id":"反模式-两种失败的混合"},{"level":2,"text":"让两层互指：路由器模式","id":"让两层互指-路由器模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Agent 能用的文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-agents-can-use"},"next":{"title":"README 作为入口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/kinds-of-docs-that-help/readme-as-entry-point"}}